msgid "📚 Yashil Energiya va Uglerod Izi Qo'llanmasi"
msgstr "📚 Green Energy and Carbon Footprint Guide"

msgid "\n            Ushbu virtual laboratoriyaning maqsadi faqatgina sarf-xarajatlarni hisoblash emas, balki kundalik hayotimizda oddiy odatlarni o'zgartirish orqali tabiatni asrashga hissa qo'shishdir.\n            "
msgstr "\n            The purpose of this virtual laboratory is not only to calculate expenses but also to contribute to nature conservation by changing simple everyday habits.\n            "

msgid "\"Kutish rejimi\" (Standby) siri"
msgstr "The secret of \"Standby\" mode"

msgid "\n                    Ko'pchilik jihozlar (TV, kompyuter, zaryadchilar) o'chirilgan holatda ham rozetkaga suqilgan bo'lsa, energiya sarflashda davom etadi. Buni \"vampir energiya\" deb atashadi. Ularni to'liq uzib qo'yish orqali umumiy sarfni 5-10% gacha kamaytirish mumkin.\n                    "
msgstr "\n                    Many appliances (TV, computers, chargers) continue to consume energy even when turned off if plugged in. This is called \"vampire energy\". By completely unplugging them, total consumption can be reduced by 5-10%.\n                    "

msgid "Yoritish tizimlari"
msgstr "Lighting systems"

msgid "\n                    An'anaviy cho'g'lanma lampalarni LED lampalarga almashtiring. LED lampalar 80% gacha kamroq energiya sarflaydi va 25 barobar uzoqroq xizmat qiladi. Bu eng tez va samarali tejamkorlik usulidir.\n                    "
msgstr "\n                    Replace traditional incandescent bulbs with LED bulbs. LED bulbs consume up to 80% less energy and last 25 times longer. This is the fastest and most effective way to save.\n                    "

msgid "Katta jihozlardan to'g'ri foydalanish"
msgstr "Proper use of large appliances"

msgid "\n                    Muzlatgich haroratini +4°C, muzxonasini esa -18°C da saqlang. Eshigini uzoq ochiq qoldirmang. Kir yuvish mashinasini faqat to'liq yuklama bilan va pastroq haroratda (30-40°C) ishlating, chunki energiyaning 90% suvni isitishga ketadi.\n                    "
msgstr "\n                    Keep the refrigerator temperature at +4°C and the freezer at -18°C. Do not leave the door open for long. Use the washing machine only with a full load and at a lower temperature (30-40°C), as 90% of the energy goes to heating the water.\n                    "

msgid "Uglerod izi (CO2 Footprint) nima?"
msgstr "What is a Carbon Footprint (CO2)?"

msgid "\n                    Elektr stansiyalarida energiya ishlab chiqarish uchun asosan gaz va ko'mir yoqiladi. Siz qancha ko'p tok ishlatsangiz, havoga shuncha ko'p issiqxona gazi (CO2) ko'tariladi. O'zbekiston sharoitida o'rtacha 1 kVt·soat energiya 0.5 kg CO2 hosil qiladi.\n                    "
msgstr "\n                    Gas and coal are mainly burned to produce energy in power plants. The more electricity you use, the more greenhouse gas (CO2) rises into the air. In Uzbekistan, an average of 1 kWh of energy produces 0.5 kg of CO2.\n                    "

msgid "Laboratoriya xulosasi:"
msgstr "Laboratory conclusion:"

msgid "\n                Olingan bilimlarni Dashboard sahifasida sinab ko'ring. Jihozlarning ishlash soatini bir necha soatga qisqartirib, grafiklarda CO2 miqdori qanchalik tez tushishini o'z ko'zingiz bilan kuzating!\n                "
msgstr "\n                Test the acquired knowledge on the Dashboard page. Reduce the working hours of appliances by a few hours and watch with your own eyes how quickly the CO2 amount drops on the charts!\n                "

